OL,3,GNEWSACommittee says election law needs
OL,4,A'tightening up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of a committee which brings
OL,7,Fabout changes to election law has said
OL,8,Fthe findings of a recent report by
OL,9,Finternational observers shows the law
OL,10,Fneeds to be "tightened up".
OL,12,FDeputy Carina Alves, the head of the
OL,13,Fprivileges and procedures
OL,14,Fcommittee,said there were gaps in the
OL,15,Flaw concerning political financing and
OL,16,Fpolitical movements.
OL,18,FAlves was speaking after a report on
OL,19,FJersey's election by the Commonwealth
OL,20,FParliamentary Association (CPA).
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
