OL,3,GNEWSACommittee says election law needs
OL,4,A'tightening up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe CPA report recommended campaign
OL,7,Ffinance rules be tightened up after
OL,8,Fconcerns during the 2026 election about
OL,9,Fthe role and funding of political
OL,10,Fmovement Value Jersey.
